emonstrate the keeper's ability to identify individuals based on sound alone.\n\n### Modified Scenario: The Whistling Sound\n\nAt the ancient coastal-lighthouse,Keeper Thompsonwas adjustingthe massive lensmechanismwhenhehearda soft, harmonicosine-wavewhistlingsoundamidstthewavesandengine noise．Thisuniquesoundimmediatelycaughthisattentionandallowedhimtoidentifyhiscolleague,Mr．Hastings，showingtheefficacyofusingcomplexauditorycuesforpersonalinRecognition。\n\nInthisupdatedversionofthescenario,theunexpectedbutdistinctwhistlingsoundhelpsillustratehowspecificaudiopatternscanbeusedforidentificationpurposes。\n\n**Change Explaned:** The previous sound was simply described as \"whistling,\" which is common and may not stand out. By specifying it as an \"harmonic sine-wave whistle,\" it becomes more unusual while still being recognizable, emphasizing the keeper's ability to identify individuals based on sound.\n\nThis modification helps to highlight the special condition under which the lighthouse keeper recognizes his visitor.","terminal":true,"token_ids":[21291,13553,518,37614,279,897,315,17767,53,57758,614,1012,35965,11,323,582,1730,429,17767,53,284,481,22,59,568,22713,419,11,358,3465,264,15048,15860,264,326,57909,53416,48083,806,20181,1526,458,1312,380,2718,27532,13,5976,279,3681,15048,2270,279,6770,8502,11,432,1410,387,12944,553,3259,279,82529,49398,803,18511,3602,65252,13,1096,686,1492,19869,279,53416,594,5726,311,10542,7775,3118,389,5112,7484,382,14374,29053,58663,25,576,1232,380,2718,14594,271,1655,279,13833,34235,2852,57909,11,77233,25164,16123,42368,1782,10951,18342,2660,5658,2142,9309,383,54503,64,8413,11,17774,16627,482,88254,1312,380,2718,27532,309,307,267,1782,57265,437,8512,11980,58883,1986,9587,27532,318,43187,61208,25235,53103,437,20967,39517,983,80396,25235,2074,46731,27014,81,58883,39,559,819,3837,3445,287,1782,6445,292,2757,1055,970,23247,7880,10618,66,1137,1958,8987,35107,61292,3407,641,574,11768,4366,1055,1782,61422,11,1782,53859,8088,53021,1312,380,2718,2